66, dw_1301, dw_4724 (semantic_get); concepts `concept_subject_offering_facts`, `concept_course_material_programs` (semantic_get); column concepts `column_concept_total_units`, `column_concept_year_columns`, `column_concept_department_name` (semantic_get), plus `column_concept_material_status_key`, `column_concept_term_code`, `column_concept_subject_id` (full search descs). Facilities/space/HR/Moira/IAP entities from the broad search were discarded as completely unrelated to departments' subject units or library reserves. **Note: `mysql_query` failed on every attempt with `1045 Access denied for user 'root'@'localhost'` — an infrastructure/auth failure; no data verification was possible.**\n\n### 6. Recommendation\n\n**6a. Tables/columns**\n- Branch 1 ('2022 Degree-Granting Subjects'): `SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION` (`IS_DEGREE_GRANTING='Y'`, `DEPARTMENT_NAME`, `COURSE`) joined to `COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED` on `COURSE = SUBJECT_CODE` with `ACADEMIC_YEAR = 2022`; measures `COUNT(*)`, `AVG/MAX−MIN/VARIANCE(TOTAL_UNITS)`; `ACADEMIC_YEAR_DESC` from a distinct `ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL` year→desc mapping (guarantees one row per department, no fan-out); `HAVING COUNT(*) >= 5`.\n- Branch 2 ('Library Reserve Materials'): `LIBRARY_RESERVE_MATRL_DETAIL` (`LIBRARY_MATERIAL_STATUS_KEY='U'`) joined to `ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL` on `TERM_CODE` and to `COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED` on `TERM_CODE + SUBJECT_ID` (dw_1301/dw_4724 keys) for `DEPARTMENT_NAME` and `TOTAL_UNITS`; CV = `STDDEV(TOTAL_UNITS)/NULLIF(AVG(TOTAL_UNITS),0)` (dw_2180 formula, bare STDDEV per tip), grouped by department + academic year + description.\n- Combine with `UNION ALL`, NULL-filling non-applicable measures, literal reason strings, exactly the 9 requested columns in order (dw_1335 pattern).\n\n**6b/6c. Reasons** — Data: lrm carries TERM_CODE+SUBJECT_ID so the catalog join is direct; the distinct year-mapping avoids term-level fan-out corrupting the ≥5 count; catalog is the only units source with its own ACADEMIC_YEAR